      "id": "idea",
      "narration": "Humans love a specific kind of challenge. Not too hard, or we get anxious and give up. Not too easy, or we get bored and drift away. We stay most engaged right at the edge of our current ability, a task just manageable enough to be interesting. Clear calls this the Goldilocks rule. Keep your habit sitting in that sweet spot.",
